 feel more connected. You could go whale watching off the coast of California. I heard it's an incredible experience.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         If I wanted to do that, I would buy a lottery ticket ... again! This time I wouldn't give it away to a friend ... I'd better start saving money now.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         If you really wanted to go, you could save enough in a few months. We could go together! <br/>", "time": "15500"}, {"image": "engenn7le12ob05re2img01.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         You know, an Arctic cruise sounds pretty cool. What can you see?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         Narwhals, seals, polar bears, walruses and maybe an Arctic fox - they are so cute!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         Wow! I had no idea there was so much variety in the Arctic! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>:         See ... you just need to know what you're fighting for! <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:         Let's fight for the cause together, Sal.", "time": "44500"}], "coverimg": "engenn7le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}]}]}